<title>USA: Itla Capital Q4 shr $0.35 vs $0.35.</title>
<headline>Itla Capital Q4 shr $0.35 vs $0.35.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITLA Capital Corporation</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>				  Years Ended December 31,</p>
<p>				   1996	1995	1994</p>
<p>			 (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
