<p>FOURTH QUARTER 1996</p>
<p>ITLA reported net income for the fourth quarter of 1996 resulting from the operations of its wholly owned subsidiary, Imperial Thrift and Loan Association, of $2.8 million or $0.35 per share compared with net income of $1.9 million or $0.35 per share for the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
